## Webinar Training Focus
WATCH THIS TRAINING COMPLETELY TO BE OUR NEXT SUCCESS STORY

## Key Benefits & Talking Points
- How to launch self-running AI Sales Agents that continuously prospect and fill your pipeline automatically
- The breakthrough system that follows up across Email, WhatsApp, SMS, LinkedIn, and AI Voice without manual work
- How AI Voice agents qualify leads, handle objections, and help book meetings automatically
- The automated proposal engine that generates personalized hosted proposals and tracks engagement in real time
- How to manage every lead conversation from one unified inbox for maximum organization and efficiency
- The simple system for creating a 24/7 AI-powered sales machine that keeps your pipeline active and revenue moving
- How agencies, consultants, SaaS businesses, and service providers are using AI automation to increase booked calls and conversions
- The advanced automation integrations that trigger calendars, webinars, CRM updates, Slack alerts, payment links, and more
- How to leverage AI sales automation as a high-ticket service for clients and recurring monthly income opportunities
- Discover the future of automated selling using ClientForce and learn how to scale sales without scaling manual effort

## Additional Details from JV / Partner Page
ClientForce — The Future of Sales Is Autonomous. Blockbuster Launch: April 10th, 2026.

PRODUCT SUMMARY: ClientForce is the first platform where self-running AI Sales Agents handle your entire sales process end-to-end on autopilot — from prospecting to follow-up, voice calls, proposals, and closing deals. Set it up once, then watch AI agents prospect, follow up, and close 24/7 without restarting campaigns. Not a CRM or email sequencer — a self-contained army of AI agents that never sleep.

CORE VALUE: AI isn\'t just for content anymore — it runs entire sales operations end-to-end. Each agent runs a full campaign: finds leads, starts conversations, follows up, sends proposals, makes voice calls, and closes deals autonomously. Deploy multiple agents in parallel for different products, markets, or funnels.

KEY CAPABILITIES: Auto-Prospect — finds and adds new leads daily from web, widgets, Chrome extension, and scheduled lead finder. Voice Calls That Close — natural, context-aware AI calls that qualify, handle objections, warm-transfer hot leads, send booking/payment links mid-call (AI calls convert 30% faster than web-only flows). Dynamic 1:1 Proposals — personalized proposals at scale with 8× reply lift average. Multi-Channel Autopilot — Email, WhatsApp, and Voice in one flow (WhatsApp increases engagement 3–5×). Unified Inbox — all channels, one thread per contact with smart labels and next-best-action suggestions. Instant Response — replies the moment inquiries arrive.

4 SIMPLE STEPS: (1) Setup Your AI Sales Agent — choose DFY playbook or build custom for demos, services, or follow-up. (2) Connect channels and knowledge sources — docs, URLs, Email, WhatsApp, Voice; agent hunts leads and nurtures automatically. (3) Enable multi-channel autopilot — agent finds leads, sends messages, handles replies 24/7 with dynamic branching. (4) Watch the dashboard — agent learns, adapts, books meetings; conversions happen in real time.

LEAD GENERATION: Auto-Lead Finder (outbound) — keywords, roles, industries, geo, scheduled runs (5–25 leads per run), verifies and enriches automatically. Chrome Capture — one-click prospecting from LinkedIn, GMB, any website. Embeddable Lead Capture Widget — branded forms with GDPR/TCPA compliance. Agent Widget — chat, call booking, email capture, mobile-ready. Smart CSV Import with real-time email verification.

SALES PIPELINE FEATURES: Never run out of leads with 3-in-1 automated discovery. 1:1 personalized proposals and multi-channel sequences (Email, WhatsApp, LinkedIn, Voice). DFY Playbooks Library for local businesses, affiliate marketing, B2B SaaS, agencies. AI voice scripts with objection handling and warm-transfer to humans. Website becomes a sales rep with AI chat and callback forms. Lead management with activity timelines and automatic next-best follow-up. Deliverability protection — sender rotation, warm-up, verification, DNC/compliance guardrails.

ANALYTICS & TEAM: Full-funnel visibility, agent performance dashboards, voice/call metrics, source attribution, export/Zapier/webhook ready. Multiple workspaces for agencies, granular roles, round-robin assignment, human-AI barge-in on live calls, audit trails.

INTEGRATIONS: Google/Outlook calendar sync, telephony providers, WhatsApp Business API, CRM/Zapier/webhooks, Stripe/Paystack payment links, enrichment and verification providers.

FUNNEL / OFFERS: Premium — launch first AI Sales Agents with standard access (50% commission). Pro — advanced playbooks and premium templates (50% commission). Unlimited — unlimited campaigns and agents, yearly. Agency — multiple client workspaces (50% commission). Reseller — sell ClientForce as your own, keep 100% (yearly). OTO 5 Special — Automated AI Social Campaigns, up to 5 concurrent Social Agent campaigns (50% commission). Bundle — Professional + Unlimited + Reseller + Agency for $397/yr.

ROI EXAMPLE: With $2,000 average deal value, 100 monthly leads per agent, 5% conversion, 2 agents — projected $20,000+ monthly revenue. Every agent runs a full sales cycle automatically.

AFFILIATE DETAILS: Opening and closing contests plus surprise contests. 50% commissions on funnel offers. Vendor reciprocates — supports partner launches. Instant commissions for affiliates with 50+ sales; delayed for newer affiliates.

POSITIONING: "It\'s not automation. It\'s autonomy." Traditional automations end when campaigns end — ClientForce agents never stop in a continuous loop: Find → Engage → Follow up → Call → Close → Repeat. Like hiring a full sales team that never stops working.

